r\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ab7a458b-21f9-4d28-a14e-1f7f44fb15c0\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d83fca65-ab8b-4be9-92a5-f10fa2d3f178\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-41e46bc1-d3ee-4c27-92f5-790700387667\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>삼성전자·코스피, “외인·긍정 파동”에 18만원 대 지지선 확보\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c1e742a0-29a8-420b-8cae-94207fa947af\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a92efeba-2151-41e6-a556-26ea83654d9e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-923e024c-f24d-434b-bfe4-b9d756d2a419\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%BD%94%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%2018%EB%A7%8C%EC%9B%90%20%EC%A7%80%EC%A7%80%EC%84%A0%20%ED%99%95%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%B4%EB%8B%A4?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>코스피가 18만원대 지지선을 확정했나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-77b0ff88-1970-44a1-b434-9e47fbf24f6a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 외국인 순매수가 꾸준히 이어지면서 삼성전자·SK하이닉스의 매도세가 멈추고 코스피가 코스닥을 앞서 상승세를 보이고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-176aa83f-aaf7-4f3d-8f8d-6f1031c86aa2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e6c2079b-71d2-448b-80c4-2144faf9844b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-62edcdca-17c8-4ca4-b0f9-6bd02b9ae705\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%99%B8%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%88%9C%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%20%EC%A7%80%EC%86%8D%EC%9D%B4%EB%8B%A4?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>외국인 순매수가 지속되는 이유는 무엇인가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f9de9ae5-8943-4a3d-8e01-09d9d56cdd78\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 이는 외국인 투자자들의 대규모 순매수가 2주 연속 증가하면서 시장 전반에 긍정적인 흐름을 만들고 있기 때문입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-46ce90cf-e9ee-4b13-bd7d-40db707ff4a7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-62352f3a-0304-4bca-a47d-5b7099e8c606\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 현재 코스피는 18,210원(전일 대비 +1.4%) 수준을 기록하고 있으며, 코스닥도 750포인트(+0.9%) 상승해 투자 심리를 한층 끌어올리고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-058508fd-7812-44c8-aabd-094bba5e0cd1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-85ff0f4a-26f5-49ca-b429-d92a7b90d4ee\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d9dc6227-c62d-4485-aed7-62e6f9d6f700\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-496a2ffb-cb97-4ce8-8c72-5c692b82a51d\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-decc1cd1-712c-4ce6-bd4c-2943df4a3e93\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 핵심 포인트 (TL;DR)\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\" id=\"SE-8ef7cf64-bd72-4df9-8b4f-986e459f42c3\" data-compid=\"SE-8ef7cf64-bd72-4df9-8b4f-986e459f42c3\" data-a11y-title=\"표\">\u003Cbutton class=\"se-component-edge-button se-component-edge-button-top __edge-area\" type=\"button\" tab-index=\"-1\" data-compid=\"SE-8ef7cf64-bd72-4df9-8b4f-986e459f42c3\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003C/button>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-ind