v>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-631aa339-8f21-4c50-99f4-a3bca4f1bc8d\" data-compid=\"SE-631aa339-8f21-4c50-99f4-a3bca4f1bc8d\" data-a11y-title=\"본문\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-631aa339-8f21-4c50-99f4-a3bca4f1bc8d\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-1d5ecede-8526-48c1-bc28-4e302448a4b9\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-4e4401eb-06db-4414-823c-f268d6de0d42\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c15c2da3-24cb-4a73-92ec-1b508c7d2c88\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e4044a75-df2b-4d32-ab5f-8693621fb3c8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9b8b8467-44ec-47fc-8f59-73dc2c6dbee6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9c61cf1d-3d34-43fb-9458-bf5c49ec48f6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6bce10c9-6871-4d9b-9970-b1d02a5f0694\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b8844a80-8814-49e6-b2a8-dd0da421983b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 배경 &amp; 흐름 \u2013 “Mermaid 다이어그램”으로 보는 시장 구조\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-95db796d-abf3-466c-8476-5c7644be5e56\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-72c05a97-bbdd-4a6b-92d2-2fec03e8a63f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">아래 흐름도는 최근 국내증시 변동에 영향을 미친 주요 변수들을 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e1ba4b15-bfd7-4a97-85a3-46fae6ff0832\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>인과관계\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-770a11e2-28b6-4acc-9e7e-a8662b3706a1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 별로 정리한 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c6c64bf1-8938-4167-b837-097e25fc60a5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-589d5093-6d90-4132-999a-eecd54ad39a0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">mermaid graph TD A[코스닥 주식 하락] --&gt; B[변동성 관리 주의] B --&gt; C[액티브 ETF 출격 가능성] C --&gt; D[투자 기회 확대] D --&gt; E[자산운용사 전략 주목] A --&gt; F[국제 유가 급락] F --&gt; G[코스피 급등] G --&gt; H[프로그램 매수 사이드카] H --&gt; I[삼성전자, SK하이닉스 상승] I --&gt; J[환율 하락] J --&gt; K[외국인 투자자 순매수] K --&gt; L[코스닥 상승 출발] \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f2fcfd93-55ea-4622-9dcd-074f3ab7ee5e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1819f731-3682-40be-9a39-14e88cbd050a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-99589504-d2a2-4e1c-a880-470410146deb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dd8297ac-ab5b-43e2-97c2-c4c2772fb971\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">이 다이어그램을 통해 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-74d27da2-c95a-4c2e-95dc-9ea8aab1898b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%99%B8%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%88%9C%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%20%EC%BD%94%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%20%EC%BD%94%EC%8A%A4%EB%8B%A5%20%EC%97%B0%EC%87%84%20%ED%9A%A8%EA%B3%BC?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>외인 순매수가 코스피·코스닥에 미치는 연쇄 효과는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4dc7555d-71d2-43e3-a57f-205ba8769789\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">를 한눈에 파악할 수 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-62df2713-d40f-42d5-a299-5efc332ab0fa\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a4c6488c-a413-4650-a859-bddb0c409bb7\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-615eb530-e218-41c0-b654-95f05fd50b5f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-da22cbc2-a7cd-4e6f-b7ed-8c5f16665bc9\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e042b977-fb49-4a58-8f07-d57269435f61\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 왜 “외인 순매수”가 중요한가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-70ab87bf-d1b9-4df9-b63a-70f6444328aa\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-715abe36-9c2b-411d-96cc-2f0c96bf53e4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">외인 순매수는 시장 가격 상승의 핵심 동력일 뿐 아니라 전체적인 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5bf9b4c8-eaaf-448e-ba44-f383d8a76dc7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>긍정 심리\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ded0787e-bd73-4ab0-ae93-fc12afbb28da\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">를 확대시킵니다. 최근 5일간 외인 순매수 규모는 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bb82afd4-b658-48b2-bcdb-813993a0a5e6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>+1.2 %\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f529914c-0586-4d07-a884-330819630aaa\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 상승했으며, 주요 매수 종목은 삼성전자(0.8 %↑)와 SK하이닉스(0.6 %↑)입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-84f000d0-68bd-449e-aebd-285e47bf88f7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-abde6425-05e0-4c0a-869f-4dcfa533c0d0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">환율도 원/달러 1,300원 → 1,285원(↓1.2 %)으로 강세를 보이며 수입 기업·소비재 상승 기대를 부추깁니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c2dcdf74-7533-4a19-a37d-5723fa8e26a3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b2d207aa-2569-437b-a04d-a39f112ed63d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">코스피는 18,210원(+1.4 %)을, 코스닥은 750포인트(+0.9 %)를 기록하며 외인 매수 흐름이 먼저 반영된 것으로 보입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e045f738-e23a-40f9-9f8a-c56a1578def6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-78ab3e4f-34ad-4993-a4d3-959af0fedd35\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e3efcaf7-bec5-4219-830b-3319980faa37\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c059f84b-1f92-44b3-b148-7d7eeb5f2e58\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6572cbbf-c948-44a8-a7cb-9a9942fc7b37\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 현재 파동이 가져올 투자 트렌드\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4881baa3-b237-469c-a354-72dda3a9bce3\" data-compid=\"SE-4881baa3-b237-469c-a354-72dda3a9bce3\" data-a11y-title=\"표\">\u003Cbutton class=\"se-component-edge-button se-component-edge-button-top __edge-area\" type=\"button\" tab-index=\"-1\" data-compid=\"SE-4881baa3-b237-469c-a354-72dda3a9bce3\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003C/button>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator