or: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>미국\u2011이란 긴장이 외인 매도에 영향을 미칠까요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-39ae38f2-cfe8-4dc4-a153-a32f1ae44842\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 미국\u2011이란 갈등이 고조되면 글로벌 위험 프리미엄이 상승해 외인 매도가 전환될 가능성이 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b7ac16ba-8d09-4cfe-83a5-9230f9c238b1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c0a29686-5f9f-49a8-9d39-1a6646b48b3b\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u26a0\ufe0f\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-01040c08-5dff-43f0-ab8f-22d9954dcab4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-df0c685a-a662-47e5-8d4b-7effc6be6c3c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%82%B4%EB%B6%80%20%EC%A0%95%EC%B9%98%20%EB%B3%80%EC%88%98%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%8B%AC%EB%A6%AC?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>내부 정치 변수가 투자 심리에 미치는 영향은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6f5ea0b5-f724-4e27-9bb4-1f8b0f2a2f09\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 지방선거·정당 위기 등 내부 정치 변수가 투자 심리를 불안정하게 만들 수 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-df223734-e2c3-46b2-8894-41c4cf23b8f5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2c5cba4c-9ac0-45e6-8448-dc6c2672b94c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">대응 방안으로는 포트폴리오 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0bed5457-e614-4ebf-a847-9ceba1ae84d7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>분산·헷지\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-37f7c2df-62d8-4a87-9f79-dd253fcfe545\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">와 실시간 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-238d8afc-3a43-43aa-ae82-48a8e9a5618b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>외인 흐름 모니터링\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-aa4f3622-bb41-48fa-8572-b4afbb8a6b0e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">을 권장합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-40f2e7f5-0c5f-4a39-86ac-74ad3c3e1fb0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e4f6cbe9-82f3-4a47-9946-362ada5eb953\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f82a8d94-2b77-4a5d-bf4f-e782d18ddc2e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-68c48eb4-4e71-4409-b523-2b1681257a63\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>6\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ec71d72d-2e02-4f73-8831-29ca0b69ba47\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 결론 &amp; 향후 시나리오\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-table se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ac21e377-e8f0-41da-9024-75d2330e2933\" data-compid=\"SE-ac21e377-e8f0-41da-9024-75d2330e2933\" data-a11y-title=\"표\">\u003Cbutton class=\"se-component-edge-button se-component-edge-button-top __edge-area\" type=\"button\" tab-index=\"-1\" data-compid=\"SE-ac21e377-e8f0-41da-9024-75d2330e2933\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003C/button>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-ac21e377-e8f0-41da-9024-75d2330e2933\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-table se-l-default se-section-align-center se-is-block-selected se-is-selected\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cdiv class=\"__se-toolbar-slot __se-cursor-unrelated\" style=\"display: none;\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-table-container\">\u003Cdiv class=\"__se-c